    AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <https://w3id.org/agentic-cig-monitoring/obesity-glp1-monitoring> "Authoritative worked PROforma instantiation for the cig-monitoring skill. Demonstrates a populated Enquiry and Decision, State Achievement goals on therapy actions, and monitoring Actions that carry BOTH a ServiceRequest order on the Goal noun_phrase AND a full pf:metaprops string per references/MetapropsSyntax.md. Reuses PROforma classes/properties by IRI."@en)
